    "detailed_description": "An application that lets you lay down roads, this is your future non-fictional story.<br><br>These objects will be programmed when you place them on the road.<br><br>Placing cardboard that has the name of an image file will display that image.<br>Placing cardboard and adding a note to it will display the message in the note.<br>Placing a calculator with a mathematical expression attached to it will evaluate that expression.<br><br>In other words, just putting these objects on the road will program them, creating an application.<br><br><br>&quot;Is this for people who are good at programming and math and stuff?&quot;<br><br>We hear you ask. Or:<br><br>&quot;Drawing is hard, though. I can't do it, lol.&quot;<br><br>Or<br><br>&quot;You're a programmer, right? Bring me your PC.&quot;<br><br>Well, you couldn't be more wrong.<br><br>You don't need to have an in-depth knowledge of programming.<br><br><br>All we'll say is that programming is the magic of the computing world.<br><br>Now, use whatever magic you like, and craft a human story that's unforgettable.<br><br>We encourage you to make let's plays and live streams!!<br>(However, doing so will be your own responsiblity.)<br><br>[Contents]<br>Manual (HTML file)<br>Sample (Contains a number of Carp and rice files)<br>Readme(EN).txt (Text file)<br>Readme(Jp).txt (Text file)<br>Carp",
    "about_the_game": "An application that lets you lay down roads, this is your future non-fictional story.<br><br>These objects will be programmed when you place them on the road.<br><br>Placing cardboard that has the name of an image file will display that image.<br>Placing cardboard and adding a note to it will display the message in the note.<br>Placing a calculator with a mathematical expression attached to it will evaluate that expression.<br><br>In other words, just putting these objects on the road will program them, creating an application.<br><br><br>&quot;Is this for people who are good at programming and math and stuff?&quot;<br><br>We hear you ask. Or:<br><br>&quot;Drawing is hard, though. I can't do it, lol.&quot;<br><br>Or<br><br>&quot;You're a programmer, right? Bring me your PC.&quot;<br><br>Well, you couldn't be more wrong.<br><br>You don't need to have an in-depth knowledge of programming.<br><br><br>All we'll say is that programming is the magic of the computing world.<br><br>Now, use whatever magic you like, and craft a human story that's unforgettable.<br><br>We encourage you to make let's plays and live streams!!<br>(However, doing so will be your own responsiblity.)<br><br>[Contents]<br>Manual (HTML file)<br>Sample (Contains a number of Carp and rice files)<br>Readme(EN).txt (Text file)<br>Readme(Jp).txt (Text file)<br>Carp",
